          id="rotation-heading"
        >
          Approval rotation
        </h2>
        <p
          class="mb-3 text-sm text-zinc-400"
        >
          The primary owner watches the approval queue for the week; the backup covers gaps.
        </p>
        <ol
          class="divide-y divide-zinc-800"
        >
          <li
            class="flex flex-col gap-1 py-2 text-sm sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between"
